<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13823" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποστεγ-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>uncover,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυκινὸν ῥόον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Emp.
					100.14
				</span></i>
			(prob. in <i><span class="en">
				42.1
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὸν νεών</span>
			<i>unroof</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.3.30
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.4.6
			</span></i>(
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(3).325.30
			</span></i> (Thera, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>, 
				Pass.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὸ τρῆμα</span>
			<i>open</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Sotad.
				2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>take off</i> a covering, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν στέγην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
					2.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποστέγω</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i>cover closely,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				5.6.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				924a37
			</span></i>.</div>
